WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.428
Logs → WhatsApp lists every chat, newest first

00:00:03.428 --> 00:00:05.617
Click Filters

00:00:05.617 --> 00:00:09.157
Narrow by chat status

00:00:09.157 --> 00:00:14.053
Or by the customer's number, your number or a chat ID

00:00:14.053 --> 00:00:15.863
Filters show as chips and stay in the page URL

00:00:15.863 --> 00:00:19.006
Click a chat to open it

00:00:19.006 --> 00:00:20.906
Chat details: duration, variables and platform analysis

00:00:20.906 --> 00:00:23.712
Advanced analysis: your own fields

00:00:23.712 --> 00:00:26.969
Transcript: WhatsApp bubbles, template sends and tool pills

00:00:26.969 --> 00:00:32.060
Click a tool pill for its request and response

00:00:32.060 --> 00:00:35.785
The menu copies or downloads the transcript

00:00:35.785 --> 00:00:39.294
Export the filtered list by email

00:00:39.294 --> 00:00:42.099
The CSV arrives by email as a zip link
